{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly replayable with over 15 hours of gameplay for the main story, speed runs with leaderboard and difficulty levels that change the way you play! Play in both small and huge levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the way you like: Reduce the length of the game using the guide / Cheat maps if you prefer to spend less time on exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Nimillion - The Last Expedition\u2019 is a vast, physics-driven rocket ship adventure with Metroidvania-style progression. Pilot your ship using only thrusters, unlocking abilities like a grapple rope, quick boost, zero-gravity mode, lasers and more. Master precise controls to explore treacherous terrain, face environmental hazards, enemies, physics puzzles, and platforming trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I\u2019ve built this game with retro-inspired physics controls for those who crave brutal, yet fair challenges so if this is your jam and you're tired of hand-holding in modern games, this is your ultimate test of skill. It\u2019s not for casual players expecting easy wins. It's a love letter to gamers who grew up on retro challenges and thrive on the rush of overcoming difficult odds, although, your abilities will help a lot!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/332b1ed446040af086e9846e9e080dbe.poster.avif?t=1773142015\" aria-label=\"the game fluid simulation\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/332b1ed446040af086e9846e9e080dbe.webm?t=1773142015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/332b1ed446040af086e9846e9e080dbe.mp4?t=1773142015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your rocket ship through a vast, physics-simulated world using only its thrusters. No autopilot, no mercy. Every maneuver demands precision, practice, and commitment, turning simple flight into a high-stakes art form that's easy to pick up but hard to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock game-changing abilities like a grappling rope, short boost, protective shield, zero-gravity mode, lasers, and more to expand your exploration arsenal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty levels available for a perfectly tailored challenge that scales from tough to unforgiving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even with upgrades, survival hinges on your reflexes and strategy as you navigate deadly environmental hazards, solve physics puzzles, and outmaneuver or obliterate hostile entities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into over 20 hand-crafted levels, including 3 massive open-world zones filled with platforming perils, and dynamic phenomena like winds, waterfalls, gravity fields, and force fields.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your mastery on global leaderboards with speedruns.<strong> </strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACQUIRE NEW ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/915c70692dcb2c287f75164a73554dab.poster.avif?t=1773142015\" aria-label=\"Using your rocket ship abilities\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/915c70692dcb2c287f75164a73554dab.webm?t=1773142015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/915c70692dcb2c287f75164a73554dab.mp4?t=1773142015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock essential tools like a grappling rope, quick booster, zero-gravity mode, lasers, and more to evolve your rocket ship from basic flyer to unstoppable explorer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHALLENGING BOSS FIGHTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/e73171751863eae4aa58a3554efc8154.poster.avif?t=1773142015\" aria-label=\"A boss fight with enemy made of particles\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/e73171751863eae4aa58a3554efc8154.webm?t=1773142015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/e73171751863eae4aa58a3554efc8154.mp4?t=1773142015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace for epic, multi-phase encounters against strong foes. Master physics and upgrades to survive these tough boss fights that demand strategy, timing, and unyielding skill.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAVERSE DIFFICULT TERRAINS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/45207a0f95b462873df654e99fc71b76.poster.avif?t=1773142015\" aria-label=\"Rocket ship parkour in difficult terrains\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/45207a0f95b462873df654e99fc71b76.webm?t=1773142015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/45207a0f95b462873df654e99fc71b76.mp4?t=1773142015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate treacherous space environments with precision: battle howling winds, cascading waterfalls, erratic gravity fields, dense vegetation, and beyond in this challenging game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE PHYSICS TO YOUR ADVANTAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/f118dfa4c0d3e300c1c00cef687381f0.poster.avif?t=1773142015\" aria-label=\"Exploiting the laser&#039;s recoil\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/f118dfa4c0d3e300c1c00cef687381f0.webm?t=1773142015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/f118dfa4c0d3e300c1c00cef687381f0.mp4?t=1773142015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the laws of nature into weapons. Exploit gravity pulls, weapon recoil, force fields, and other realistic mechanics to solve puzzles and dominate in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >XBOX controller support with Force Feedback<br>3 Save slots<br>Online leaderboard<br>Optional FSR3/4 with FRAMEGEN</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2889880?t=1773142015","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/b99c50f395e3084850affdb84a1dacfa26ab8841/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773142015","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/790506b0e0765bf5fcab56e553860cceebc0772b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773142015","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/790506b0e0765bf5fcab56e553860cceebc0772b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773142015","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},